{"id":"sl/y90nupkv","index":0,"elements":[{"id":"sh/ul4vaxgb","kind":"shape","position":{"left":0,"top":0,"width":13,"height":720}},{"id":"sh/547294r6","kind":"textbox","text":"上板运行：同一套硬件，三个程序","position":{"left":58,"top":32,"width":1140,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/k3yl0zql","kind":"shape","position":{"left":58,"top":105,"width":1162,"height":2}},{"id":"sh/7qp4be9c","kind":"textbox","text":"01","position":{"left":1165,"top":36,"width":50,"height":30}},{"id":"sh/65g3298r","kind":"shape","position":{"left":56,"top":141,"width":728,"height":363}},{"id":"im/cj21o7ed","kind":"image","position":{"left":61.1,"top":145,"width":717.8,"height":355}},{"id":"sh/sryl4zqx","kind":"textbox","text":"终端菜单选择程序","position":{"left":825,"top":151,"width":375,"height":44}},{"id":"sh/fu94fe98","kind":"textbox","text":"UART 上传对应机器码\nCPU 运行所选程序\n终端显示板上返回的状态","position":{"left":825,"top":207,"width":367,"height":180}},{"id":"sh/utg3698n","kind":"shape","position":{"left":825,"top":429,"width":363,"height":2}},{"id":"sh/wn6dc7eh","kind":"textbox","text":"流水灯   2048   贪吃蛇","position":{"left":825,"top":462,"width":370,"height":43}},{"id":"sh/hofulsf2","kind":"textbox","text":"一次只运行一个程序\n切换时无需重新生成 bitstream","position":{"left":60,"top":548,"width":1120,"height":80}}],"notes":{"text":"讲解提示：\n承接前一位同学的 CPU 设计。说明统一菜单在电脑端，三个应用共用 FPGA 中的 CPU、RAM 和外设。不要说三个程序同时运行。建议 45 秒。\n\n资料来源：\n• 用户提供：选择菜单界面.png\n• runtime_system/README.md"}}
{"id":"sl/hwbqtkby","index":1,"elements":[{"id":"sh/ahwrqhgj","kind":"shape","position":{"left":0,"top":0,"width":13,"height":720}},{"id":"sh/9072xkry","kind":"textbox","text":"UART：上传程序与运行时交互","position":{"left":58,"top":32,"width":1140,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/ozy1ofad","kind":"shape","position":{"left":58,"top":105,"width":1162,"height":2}},{"id":"sh/b29kza94","kind":"textbox","text":"02","position":{"left":1165,"top":36,"width":50,"height":30}},{"id":"sh/a10jqpsj","kind":"textbox","text":"SW7 = 1  加载模式","position":{"left":63,"top":145,"width":500,"height":35}},{"id":"sh/x4r21kru","kind":"textbox","text":"电脑发送 16 位机器码\nLoader 写入程序 RAM\nCPU 保持复位","position":{"left":63,"top":191,"width":480,"height":137}},{"id":"sh/w3i1sfa9","kind":"textbox","text":"SW7 = 0  运行模式","position":{"left":668,"top":145,"width":500,"height":35}},{"id":"sh/r65knqtk","kind":"textbox","text":"CPU 从 0x000 取指\n电脑发送按键\nCPU 返回状态帧","position":{"left":668,"top":191,"width":480,"height":137}},{"id":"sh/q5wjelsz","kind":"shape","position":{"left":620,"top":150,"width":2,"height":182}},{"id":"sh/ove9o7yd","kind":"shape","position":{"left":62,"top":364,"width":565,"height":128}},{"id":"sh/9wnqhczy","kind":"textbox","text":"wire cpu_rst = rst | load_mode;\nassign uart_tx = load_mode\n    ? loader_uart_tx : cpu_uart_tx;","position":{"left":82,"top":378,"width":525,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/mtwrmxg7","kind":"shape","position":{"left":655,"top":364,"width":565,"height":178}},{"id":"sh/nu58f2hs","kind":"textbox","text":"0x10  UART 数据：读按键 / 写字节\n0x11  UART 状态：rx_valid / tx_ready\n\nINP R0, 0x11   → 检查接收状态\nOUP 0x10, R0   → 发送状态字节","position":{"left":675,"top":378,"width":525,"height":150}},{"id":"sh/wjy9sry9","kind":"textbox","text":"板载 CP2103 完成 USB 转串口；FPGA 内部 UART 收发与 CPU 端口由 Verilog 实现","position":{"left":62,"top":584,"width":1156,"height":58}},{"id":"sh/xk7qlczu","kind":"textbox","text":"Loader：两个 8 位字节拼成一条 16 位指令，写入 1K×16 程序 RAM。","position":{"left":62,"top":643,"width":1156,"height":37}}],"notes":{"text":"讲解提示：\n先讲 SW7=1 的 Loader：PC 菜单选镜像，Loader 两个 8 位字节拼成 16 位指令写入 1K×16 程序 RAM。再讲 SW7=0：CPU 读取 0x11 状态，读写 0x10 数据。电脑绘图，游戏规则由板上程序处理。这里总共约 1 分 20 秒。\n\n资料来源：\n• runtime_system/rtl/top/runtime_soc.v\n• runtime_system/rtl/peripherals/uart_port.v\n• runtime_system/rtl/peripherals/io_decoder.v\n• runtime_system/rtl/peripherals/program_loader.v"}}
{"id":"sl/ofy9wn61","index":2,"elements":[{"id":"sh/m1c3mlsn","kind":"shape","position":{"left":0,"top":0,"width":13,"height":720}},{"id":"sh/cza94vmx","kind":"textbox","text":"2048：棋盘更新与游戏结束","position":{"left":58,"top":32,"width":1140,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/d0jax03i","kind":"shape","position":{"left":58,"top":105,"width":1162,"height":2}},{"id":"sh/298ryl4v","kind":"textbox","text":"05","position":{"left":1165,"top":36,"width":50,"height":30}},{"id":"sh/3ah8rqlg","kind":"shape","position":{"left":56,"top":150,"width":558,"height":477}},{"id":"im/twvmpszq","kind":"image","position":{"left":81.51,"top":154,"width":506.99,"height":469}},{"id":"sh/pcjqtg36","kind":"shape","position":{"left":664,"top":150,"width":558,"height":477}},{"id":"im/rqxozmh4","kind":"image","position":{"left":690.46,"top":154,"width":505.08,"height":469}},{"id":"sh/n6ls3alk","kind":"textbox","text":"正常运行：移动、合并、计分","position":{"left":60,"top":632,"width":555,"height":35}},{"id":"sh/n2l4fq98","kind":"textbox","text":"满盘且无可合并方块：结束","position":{"left":665,"top":632,"width":555,"height":35}}],"notes":{"text":"讲解提示：\n左图说明 4×4 棋盘和分数。右图说明 GAME OVER；先检查空格，再检查横向、纵向是否有相同相邻块。注意两张图是不同时间状态，不要声称它们构成完整连续操作录像。约 45 秒。\n\n资料来源：\n• 用户提供：2048.png\n• 用户提供：2048结束.png\n• runtime_system/games/2048/README.md"}}
{"id":"sl/jyx0ra1s","index":3,"elements":[{"id":"sh/v6tsv2xo","kind":"shape","position":{"left":0,"top":0,"width":13,"height":720}},{"id":"sh/1cj2d8b6","kind":"textbox","text":"2048：CPU 完成压缩、合并与计分","position":{"left":58,"top":32,"width":1140,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/0ba143al","kind":"shape","position":{"left":58,"top":105,"width":1162,"height":2}},{"id":"sh/rm1k7yt4","kind":"textbox","text":"06","position":{"left":1165,"top":36,"width":50,"height":30}},{"id":"sh/ql8jytsj","kind":"textbox","text":"RAM 0x40–0x4F：16 个格子；0x50–0x53：单行临时缓冲","position":{"left":60,"top":145,"width":1160,"height":40}},{"id":"sh/doj29oba","kind":"shape","position":{"left":60,"top":207,"width":1160,"height":90}},{"id":"sh/sna103ap","kind":"textbox","text":"输入","position":{"left":82,"top":224,"width":100,"height":28}},{"id":"sh/3ihk3et8","kind":"textbox","text":"2   空   2   4","position":{"left":183,"top":219,"width":394,"height":38}},{"id":"sh/ih8ju9sn","kind":"textbox","text":"左移后","position":{"left":666,"top":224,"width":125,"height":28}},{"id":"sh/kbm987y5","kind":"textbox","text":"4   4   空   空","position":{"left":798,"top":219,"width":375,"height":38}},{"id":"sh/5cva1cfq","kind":"shape","position":{"left":60,"top":343,"width":440,"height":159}},{"id":"sh/i94r6xgz","kind":"textbox","text":"LDR  R1, R3\nADDI R1, 0x01\nSTR  R3, R1","position":{"left":80,"top":357,"width":400,"height":131}},{"id":"sh/jadsz2xk","kind":"textbox","text":"相同指数合并后加 1\n例如 2+2：指数 1 变为 2","position":{"left":539,"top":340,"width":631,"height":90}},{"id":"sh/w72947yt","kind":"textbox","text":"四条逻辑行共用一套处理代码；每个方块一次移动最多合并一次。","position":{"left":60,"top":534,"width":1160,"height":41}},{"id":"sh/x8vaxsfe","kind":"textbox","text":"只有棋盘发生变化，CPU 才从 LFSR 端口 0x13 取随机数并生成新方块。","position":{"left":60,"top":590,"width":1160,"height":52}},{"id":"sh/a5kr2xg3","kind":"textbox","text":"计分由 CPU 重复加倍算出合并方块数值，再累加到 16 位分数。","position":{"left":60,"top":645,"width":1160,"height":34}}],"notes":{"text":"讲解提示：\n约 1 分 20 秒。讲指数存储：0空，1=2，2=4。四方向改变的是逻辑行读取顺序。程序跳过零值，和临时行最后一块比较，合并过的标志避免 2+2+2+2 一步合为 8。CPU写回新棋盘，与旧值比较决定是否生成新方块。计分用重复自加求 2 的幂。\n\n资料来源：\n• runtime_system/games/2048/program/game_2048.asm\n• runtime_system/rtl/peripherals/lfsr8.v"}}
{"id":"sl/i107q5of","index":4,"elements":[{"id":"sh/v2twb6dw","kind":"shape","position":{"left":0,"top":0,"width":13,"height":720}},{"id":"sh/dgbulwnm","kind":"textbox","text":"贪吃蛇：移动、成长与结束","position":{"left":58,"top":32,"width":1140,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/cf2tcr61","kind":"shape","position":{"left":58,"top":105,"width":1162,"height":2}},{"id":"sh/z2tcnm5s","kind":"textbox","text":"07","position":{"left":1165,"top":36,"width":50,"height":30}},{"id":"sh/yhkbe1o7","kind":"shape","position":{"left":54,"top":148,"width":551,"height":238}},{"id":"im/g7atobq5","kind":"image","position":{"left":58,"top":155.51,"width":543,"height":222.98}},{"id":"sh/032tgr6d","kind":"shape","position":{"left":670,"top":148,"width":551,"height":238}},{"id":"im/apobah8v","kind":"image","position":{"left":674,"top":152.5,"width":543,"height":229}},{"id":"sh/m5kbi1oj","kind":"shape","position":{"left":347,"top":419,"width":583,"height":240}},{"id":"im/rqdw7qls","kind":"image","position":{"left":357.3,"top":423,"width":562.41,"height":232}},{"id":"sh/x4vedgvm","kind":"textbox","text":"起始状态","position":{"left":60,"top":385,"width":540,"height":32}},{"id":"sh/ahkvi1cb","kind":"textbox","text":"得分 6，等级 3，节拍 0.125 s","position":{"left":674,"top":385,"width":543,"height":32}}],"notes":{"text":"讲解提示：\n三图用于展示不同状态：初始、成长加速、GAME OVER。游戏结束图是另一局，不能当作右上图的连续下一帧。现场可演示方向键与碰撞。约 55 秒。\n\n资料来源：\n• 用户提供：贪吃蛇1.png\n• 用户提供：贪吃蛇2.png\n• 用户提供：贪吃蛇游戏结束.png"}}
{"id":"sl/x8f69ofe","index":5,"elements":[{"id":"sh/5svutgni","kind":"shape","position":{"left":0,"top":0,"width":13,"height":720}},{"id":"sh/yhg7epsj","kind":"textbox","text":"贪吃蛇：坐标计算与蛇身更新","position":{"left":58,"top":32,"width":1140,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/zi98nu94","kind":"shape","position":{"left":58,"top":105,"width":1162,"height":2}},{"id":"sh/87ipkzal","kind":"textbox","text":"08","position":{"left":1165,"top":36,"width":50,"height":30}},{"id":"sh/98rqt4r6","kind":"textbox","text":"位置 = 行 × 16 + 列","position":{"left":60,"top":149,"width":523,"height":40}},{"id":"sh/ml07i9sv","kind":"textbox","text":"上 −0x10   下 +0x10   左 −1   右 +1","position":{"left":60,"top":202,"width":1160,"height":38}},{"id":"sh/7m98ru9g","kind":"shape","position":{"left":60,"top":274,"width":552,"height":190}},{"id":"sh/oryp8fah","kind":"textbox","text":"AND  R3, R2    ; 取列号 0x0F\nCMP  R3, R2    ; 是否最右列\nJZ   GAME_OVER\nADDI R0, 0x01  ; 向右一格","position":{"left":80,"top":288,"width":512,"height":162}},{"id":"sh/pc76hkr2","kind":"shape","position":{"left":661,"top":274,"width":557,"height":190}},{"id":"sh/h4bupgn6","kind":"textbox","text":"LDR  R0, R3    ; 读地图格\nCMP  R0, R1    ; 判断墙 / 空格\nJZ   DECAY_NEXT  ; 需要时跳过\n...\nSUB  R0, R1    ; 蛇身寿命减一\nSTR  R3, R0    ; 写回地图","position":{"left":681,"top":288,"width":517,"height":162}},{"id":"sh/w32twb6l","kind":"textbox","text":"RAM 0x04–0x83 保存 128 格：0 = 空，0xFF = 墙，其他非零值 = 蛇身寿命","position":{"left":60,"top":514,"width":1160,"height":70}},{"id":"sh/v2tcn650","kind":"textbox","text":"CPU 遍历地图、判断碰撞和食物，再把 140 字节状态帧经 UART 发给终端。","position":{"left":60,"top":605,"width":1160,"height":44}},{"id":"sh/u1kbu1ov","kind":"textbox","text":"食物由随机数端口选空格；16 次未命中后顺序扫描，避免无限重试。","position":{"left":60,"top":655,"width":1160,"height":34}}],"notes":{"text":"讲解提示：\n约 1 分 20 秒。解释 16 列使得上下移动为加减 0x10；AND 0x0F 检查左右边界。每次步进遍历 128 格，蛇身寿命减 1，尾部归零，新的头格写当前长度。新头读目标格判断墙/蛇身，再比较食物位置。食物从 LFSR 取随机数，16 次失败后顺序扫描。代码只截关键行，讲述中说明实际循环还有跳转与地址增量。\n\n资料来源：\n• runtime_system/program/snake.asm"}}